WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:07.000
Welcome to Research — Nivesh's Filings Intelligence. It has already read every corporate disclosure filed on the NSE and BSE.

00:07.000 --> 00:12.000
Start with the ask bar, or pick a curated theme — every answer is grounded in the actual filings.

00:12.000 --> 00:20.000
"Read for you" ranks the day's material filings by how much they matter — switch to the latest at any time.

00:20.000 --> 00:32.000
Open one and the AI insight explains it in plain language — with page-level citations back to the source document.

00:32.000 --> 00:45.000
The full feed holds over six thousand filings. Sort by materiality and skim what's new across the market.

00:45.000 --> 00:48.000
Filter to a single category — here, earnings.

00:48.000 --> 01:02.000
Expand any filing for a sectioned summary — quick take, sentiment, outlook and risks — each line cited to a page.

01:02.000 --> 01:12.000
Search a company to scope everything to it — the feed, the counts, and its document library.

01:12.000 --> 01:26.000
Its whole library is here: quarterly results, annual reports, transcripts and presentations — each downloadable.

01:26.000 --> 01:29.000
Clear the company to return to the whole market.

01:29.000 --> 01:40.000
Finally, Alerts — choose the filing types that matter to you and where they should reach you.

01:40.000 --> 01:41.000
That's Research, in two minutes.
